ios: an item drag presses where the finger went down

A drag only starts once the finger has moved TOUCH_SLOP (10 CSS px, about 13 game px), and it pressed at the
finger's position at that moment, which can already be over the neighbouring inventory or bank slot (icons are
32 px with a 4 px gap): touching the lower half of an item and dragging down moved the item below it. The press
now happens at the touch-down point, and the minimenu (where mouseLoop takes the dragged slot from) is rebuilt
for that point first.

diff --git a/src/client/Client.ts b/src/client/Client.ts
index 5b185a9..a8e3523 100644
--- a/src/client/Client.ts
+++ b/src/client/Client.ts
